@ui @blog-detail
Feature: Blog article detail page

    @smoke
    Scenario: As a user, I should see the article title, publication information and content, when I navigate to a valid blog article URL

    Scenario: As a user, I should see a not-found or error state, when I navigate to an invalid blog slug

    Scenario: As a user, I should read the article without horizontal overflow, when I open a blog article at 375 pixels
